Title: Mountain, Ltd. | Engineering & Construction Services
Content: # Mountain, Ltd.

**Engineering & Construction Services**

Mountain, Ltd. is a full-service engineering and construction firm specializing in telecommunications. Since 1972, we've provided expert solutions in outside plant (OSP) design, construction management, and project coordination for wireless and wireline networks. Our team combines deep industry experience with cutting-edge tools and methodologies to deliver reliable, scalable infrastructure across the country.

[Services](#services)

[About](#about)

[Projects](#projects)

[Careers](#careers)

[Contact](#contact)

## Services

Mountain, Ltd. offers a comprehensive suite of telecommunications engineering and construction services:

**OSP Design & Engineering**

Full outside plant design for both fiber and copper networks, including route planning, CAD/GIS drafting, and permit preparation.

**Wireless Infrastructure**

Site acquisition, structural analysis, and RF design for small cell, DAS, and macro tower deployments.

**Construction Management**

Oversight of fiber and wireless construction projects, QC, and contractor coordination.

**Permit Coordination**

Permit application, agency coordination, and tracking across jurisdictions.

**BEAD Program Support**

Grant application assistance and technical support for BEAD-funded broadband projects.

**Project Management**

End-to-end project management for complex multi-site deployments.

## About

Founded in 1972, Mountain, Ltd. has over five decades of experience in telecommunications infrastructure. Our team of engineers, designers, and project managers work across the wireline and wireless sectors. We are a certified small business and have worked with major carriers, utilities, and municipalities across Florida and the Southeast.

Headquartered in Orlando, Florida, with project reach spanning the eastern United States.

## Projects

Our portfolio includes OSP design, construction oversight, and permit coordination for fiber and wireless deployments across Florida and the Southeast.

[View Projects](#)

## Careers

We are currently seeking talented professionals to join our growing team.

[View Open Positions](#)

## Contact

Reach us at our Orlando headquarters.

**Address:** 1415 E Robinson St, Orlando, FL 32801

**Phone:** (407) 555-0192

**Email:** info@mountainltd.com
