Content: # Capabilities

## OSP Design & Engineering

Mountain, Ltd. provides full outside plant design services for fiber and copper networks. Our designers use industry-standard tools including AutoCAD, MicroStation, and GIS platforms to produce construction drawings, permit packages, and as-built documentation.

**Key capabilities:**
- Route planning and survey
- Conduit and aerial plant design
- CAD/GIS drafting and documentation
- Permit package preparation
- Make-ready engineering

## Wireless Infrastructure

Our wireless team handles the full lifecycle of wireless infrastructure deployment:
- Site acquisition and lease negotiation
- Structural analysis and modification design
- RF design and optimization
- Small cell and DAS design
- Macro tower design and modification

## Construction Management

Mountain, Ltd. provides construction management services for both fiber and wireless projects:
- Contractor qualification and coordination
- QC inspection and reporting
- Schedule management
- As-built collection and documentation

## Permit Coordination

We manage the permit process from application through approval:
- Agency research and pre-application meetings
- Application preparation and submission
- Tracking and follow-up
- Response to agency comments

## Technology

Mountain, Ltd. leverages modern tools and platforms across all service lines:
- AutoCAD and MicroStation for CAD drafting
- Esri ArcGIS for spatial data management
- Katapult for aerial strand mapping and design
- Proprietary project management tools

